I include a patch to replace the single instance of kmirrord per system by =

a private version of kmirrord per mirror set. This is required, if you=20
configure the persistent dirty log to reside on a mirror set for=20
availability and disaster recovery reasons.

Please comment, and apply.

Best Regards
